&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate has a strong foundation in accounting processes, hands-on experience with data analysis, strong project management skills, and the ability to work across departments to solve problems in a fast-paced environment with conflicting priorities. In this position you will act as end-to-end owner of the master data lifecycle while driving data governance best practices and owning data dictionaries for key finance objects.&lt;/p&gt;
