&lt;li&gt;Perform data profiling, quality assessment, and KPI reporting on governance metrics, and support root cause analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate governance council or data stewardship councils with cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
