&lt;p&gt;This role requires a seasoned compensation professional who can operate independently, exercise sound judgment on sensitive pay matters, and confidently engage with senior stakeholders, including executives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
