&lt;li&gt;Partner with executive leadership on executive compensation design, including base, bonus, and equity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor market trends and regulatory changes (e.g., pay transparency laws) to keep programs current and compliant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Program Design &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
