&lt;li&gt;Design and administer annual compensation cycles, including merit, bonus, and equity refresh programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain compensation policies, guidelines, and governance frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Finance on compensation budgeting, modeling, and forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hiring, Retention &amp;amp; Business Partnership&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
