&lt;li&gt;Advise hiring managers and senior leaders on compensation strategy for critical and hard-to-fill roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present compensation analysis, recommendations, and program updates to senior leaders and cross-functional stakeholders in a clear, compelling manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
