&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting enterprise sales at a VC-backed technology, cloud infrastructure or other high-growth technology company through periods of rapid scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify and address data protection issues in commercial transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in AI, machine learning, and emerging technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
