&lt;li&gt;Draft, negotiate, and review marketing, events, and brand agreements, including production agreements, sponsorship agreements, attendee agreements, content waivers and releases, and co-branding deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review marketing, advertising, and communications materials for IP, advertising, and other legal risk&lt;/li&gt;
