&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a subject matter expert (SME) in Data Center Commissioning and Quality. This role requires direct knowledge of data center construction, with a strong focus on MEP systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work directly with CoreWeave’s project coordination team to make sure projects across the CoreWeave portfolio are completed on time and to the highest quality standards. You will oversee the installation and testing of components and systems, including mission-critical systems such as generators, UPS systems, electrical distribution equipment, and redundancy protocols, as well as cooling systems such as chillers and CDUs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a remote-eligible position with 50% travel required. Candidates must live in or near one of these regions: Northern Virginia; Dallas, Texas; Richmond, Virginia; Livingston, New Jersey; or Atlanta, Georgia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
