&lt;li&gt;Keep safety at the forefront of all construction initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with general contractors, trade partners, and vendors as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a liaison between clients and internal teams, facilitating communication during commissioning activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review all written documentation, including commissioning and quality-related information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop, review, and implement commissioning plans as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help coordinate and attend pre-construction commissioning meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend construction progress and pre-installation job-site meetings to gather relevant information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review meeting minutes for necessary revisions and help resolve discrepancies related to design intent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspect field installations, witness functional and commissioning tests, and conduct site visits as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to sites, client meetings, and training as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop reports for leadership teams and clients on project progress, problems, and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
