&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in MEP commissioning, ideally within data centers or critical facilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of data center systems, BMS/EPMS, and MEP building systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with electrical and low-voltage equipment coordination, and with commissioning or quality assurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with relevant design and local codes, as well as industry standards (NEC, NFPA, IEEE, ASHRAE).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office applications (Excel, Word, Outlook).&lt;/li&gt;
