&lt;p&gt;CoreWeave is seeking an exceptional Global Director, Field Performance &amp;amp; Intelligence to own the performance and intelligence engine of our revenue organization — the discipline that translates strategy into operating model, operating rhythms that keep the field on track and strategic initiatives that drive performance. Reporting directly to the Global Vice President, Revenue Operations, you will own go-to-market coverage and role design, demand, supply &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp; revenue modeling, predictive forecasting, performance analytics, operating rhythms, and global performance initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a pivotal moment for CoreWeave, as we scale our revenue operations infrastructure to support our trajectory as a newly public AI hyperscaler. You will bring enterprise-grade operational rigor to how CoreWeave organizes and runs the revenue organization while maintaining the startup mindset, agility, and innovation that defines CoreWeave. As the owner of this Center of Excellence, you will lead and grow the Field Performance &amp;amp; Intelligence team, set the performance and analytics standard that the field and our regional teams run on, and partner with the other RevOps pillars and regional leaders to ensure performance scales consistently across segments and geographies.You will partner with the Field Planning &amp;amp; Incentives RevOps COE to ensure aligned territories, quotas and field incentive compensation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
