&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead and grow the Field Performance &amp;amp; Intelligence team, developing the team’s capabilities and maturing it into a high-performing function as CoreWeave scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GTM Coverage &amp;amp; Role Design: &lt;/strong&gt;Own go-to-market coverage models and role design, ensuring the right roles and segment coverage to maximize revenue potential and support efficient growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue Modeling &amp;amp; Predictive Forecasting: &lt;/strong&gt;Own long-range demand and supply revenue models, and predictive forecasting methodologies that give leadership accurate, forward-looking visibility into revenue trajectories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Analytics &amp;amp; Operating Rhythms: &lt;/strong&gt;Deliver performance analytics and global operating rhythms — the in-quarter performance views, business reviews, and historical retrospectives — that turn data into insight and keep the revenue organization accountable to results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Performance Initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Go beyond insights and drive actions that will result in high performance, through structured initiatives such as enterprise verticals expansion, win/loss and red accounts program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Pillar &amp;amp; Regional Partnership: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with Field Planning &amp;amp; Incentives, Field Process &amp;amp; Automation, Field Readiness, Deal Strategy &amp;amp; Execution, and regional/functional RevOps leaders to ensure performance and intelligence standards scale consistently and adopt cleanly across segments and geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years in revenue operations, sales operations, or sales strategy, in high-growth B2B technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in revenue organization operating models &amp;amp; high performance operating rhythms for complex sales organizations with multiple segments and product lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of revenue modeling, forecasting methodologies, that drive accurate revenue predictability.&lt;/li&gt;
