&lt;p&gt;You will work directly with engineers and subject matter experts to capture knowledge that today exists only in people&#39;s heads, and you will help maintain the CMS structure, navigation, and content lifecycle that makes it findable. You will work to the standards set by the Staff Knowledge Architect and take requests through our intake process from scoping to publication.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
