&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wondering if you&#39;re a good fit? We believe in investing in our people, and value candidates who can bring their own diversified experiences to our teams, even if you aren&#39;t a 100% skill or experience match. Here are a few qualities we&#39;ve found compatible with our team. If some of this describes you, we&#39;d love to talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love turning an undocumented system into a page someone can actually follow at 2 AM during an incident.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re curious about how things work, and you ask the question the engineer assumed everyone already knew the answer to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re an expert at structuring information so people find it without being told where it lives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;d rather fix the root cause of a recurring question than answer it again.&lt;/li&gt;
