&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CoreWeave, a leader in AI cloud platforms, we are seeking a Product Strategy Principal. In this pivotal role, you will join the Product Team, focusing on the development of a portfolio level product strategy. Your work will directly impact CoreWeave’s product strategy and roadmap and influence the company’s leadership team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Product Strategy Principal, your primary responsibility will be to lead the development of a compelling multi-year product strategy to support the overall strategic goals of CoreWeave. You will develop deep insight about the customer needs and the market and&amp;nbsp; translate these insights into a compelling product strategy and roadmap, ensuring CoreWeave remains at the forefront of the AI Hyperscaler market. Collaborating closely with product and engineering teams, you will guide the portfolio strategy to align different product areas to a common strategy, maintaining a balance between cutting-edge technology, user-friendliness, and market viability.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute a clear, forward-thinking product strategy and roadmap for CoreWeave&#39;s portfolio of products, aligning with both market trends and the company’s overall objectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct in-depth market research to identify emerging trends, workloads, technologies, and potential opportunities in the AI Hyperscaler domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with product and engineering and design teams to align different products in CoreWeave’s portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the voice of the customer within the organization, integrating customer feedback and requirements into product development to ensure maximum satisfaction and usability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Liaise with marketing, sales, and customer support teams to ensure successful product launches, market positioning, and ongoing lifecycle management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Management and Cadence:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and lead operating rhythms for business cadences (monthly, quarterly, annual) related to strategy and business reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wondering if you’re a good fit? We believe in investing in our people, and value candidates who can bring their own diversified experiences to our teams – even if you aren&#39;t a 100% skill or experience match. Here are a few qualities we’ve found compatible with our team. If some of this describes you, we’d love to talk.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience (7+ years) in product strategy, product management management or product operations, preferably with a focus on AI, ML, Cloud and SaaS technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of the AI and ML technology landscape, including current trends and potential future directions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership and communication skills, with the ability to drive product vision and strategy across diverse teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving abilities, with a track record of making data-informed decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Business, or a related field, with a strong understanding of machine learning concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why CoreWeave?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CoreWeave, we work hard, have fun, and move fast!&amp;nbsp; We’re in an exciting stage of hyper-growth that you will not want to miss out on. We’re not afraid of a little chaos, and we’re constantly learning. Our team cares deeply about how we build our product and how we work together, which is represented through our core values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be Curious at Your Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act Like an Owner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empower Employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver Best-in-Class Client Experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve More Together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We support and encourage an entrepreneurial outlook and independent thinking. We foster an environment that encourages collaboration and enables the development of innovative solutions to complex problems. As we get set for takeoff, the organization&#39;s growth opportunities are constantly expanding. You will be surrounded by some of the best talent in the industry, who will want to learn from you, too. Come join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;The base salary range for this role is $206,000 to $303,000. The starting salary will be determined based on job-related knowledge, skills, experience, and market location. We strive for both market alignment and internal equity when determining compensation. In addition to base salary, our total rewards package includes a discretionary bonus, equity awards, and a comprehensive benefits program (all based on eligibility).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
