&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;About the Team&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Operations Accounting organization at CoreWeave performs operational accounting, control, reporting, and compliance for the critical AI infrastructure of our rapidly scaling AI cloud business. The team manages a variety of core accounting and reporting processes and controls globally and partners with Treasury, Supply Chain, Procurement, FP&amp;amp;A, Leasing, Legal, and Tax to track, control, and provide visibility to the company&#39;s compute and supporting assets. The group develops and operationalizes accounting and reporting processes that enable visibility, control, and confident decisions, and collaborates with stakeholders to quickly find solutions to challenging problems in support of hyper growth.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare journal entries and reconciliations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operationalize and enhance reporting to support operational decisions and reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with accounting team peers to enhance supporting processes and information flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapt reporting processes to appropriately incorporate new financing transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of accounting and financial reporting experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Accounting, Finance, or Business (or equivalent) required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process- and data-driven, with strong analytical judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, organized, and adaptable in a dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal, written, and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth mindset and a commitment to continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Skills:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional qualification (e.g., ACA/CPA/CMA/CA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public accounting experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NetSuite experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love collaborating across teams to solve complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re curious about where data, systems, and policy meet.&lt;/li&gt;
