&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Director, Managing Associate General Counsel, Real Estate Development, you will support complex real estate development, construction, and infrastructure transactions across the company’s expanding global data center portfolio. You will partner closely with stakeholders across Development, Construction, Data Center Operations, Finance, Tax, and Procurement to advance large-scale infrastructure projects in a rapidly scaling environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your day-to-day will include advising on commercial real estate transactions, real property due diligence, construction and infrastructure agreements, professional services agreements, permitting and entitlement matters, transaction execution, and construction risk management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide legal support across all phases of commercial real estate development and infrastructure projects, from site acquisition through construction and operational delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, review, and negotiate commercial real estate agreements, including purchase and sale agreements, development agreements, and site control documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, review, and negotiate construction and infrastructure agreements, including design and engineering agreements, construction management agreements, and contractor agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on zoning, permitting, entitlement, land use, utility, and other regulatory matters impacting infrastructure development projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support transaction execution, due diligence, and closing processes across complex real estate and infrastructure matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on construction risk allocation, delays, claims management, indemnities, warranties, and dispute resolution matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Development, Power, Operations, Finance, Tax, Procurement, and external stakeholders to support infrastructure deployment and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage outside counsel while balancing legal risk and commercial priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop scalable legal templates, playbooks, and contracting processes to support CoreWeave’s continued growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
