&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;J.D. from an ABA-accredited law school and active admission to practice law in at least one U.S. jurisdiction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of relevant legal experience supporting commercial real estate development, construction, and infrastructure transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience drafting, reviewing, and negotiating complex commercial real estate agreements and construction-related agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing title, survey, zoning, land use, permitting, utility, entitlement, and related regulatory matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading real estate due diligence processes and transaction closings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising on construction risk allocation, claims management, indemnities, warranties, and dispute resolution matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage outside counsel and balance legal risk with commercial business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating cross-functionally with development, finance, operations, tax, and procurement teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgment, communication skills, and ability to operate effectively in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
