&lt;p&gt;This position reports directly to the Director of Cloud Platform Support, is global in scope, and will work closely with leaders across Solutions Architecture, Support, Sales, and Product Engineering teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
