&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the TSM function within CoreWeave by &lt;/strong&gt;building, leading, and focusing on hiring top talent and fostering their growth to ensure they excel as the primary technical advocates for CoreWeave’s most strategic customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across functions, &lt;/strong&gt;working closely with leaders in Solutions Architecture, Support, Sales, and Product Engineering to elevate and enhance the CoreWeave customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
