&lt;li&gt;B.S. in Computer Science or a related technical discipline, or equivalent experience with an advanced degree in a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;15+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in software engineering, systems engineering, hardware engineering, solutions architecture, customer support, technical program management, product management, or delivery management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
