&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute with Impact&lt;/strong&gt;: Consistently deliver high-quality outcomes across complex, often ambiguous workstreams. Balance strategic thinking with hands-on execution, stepping into the details when needed and knowing when to pull back. Consider the upstream and downstream implications of decisions before recommending a path.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pattern Recognition &amp;amp; Insights&lt;/strong&gt;: Leverage data, observations, and deep domain expertise to identify recurring patterns across P&amp;amp;E—surfacing signals proactively, synthesizing them into clear actions, and helping leaders course-correct before challenges compound.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable Change at Speed&lt;/strong&gt;: Lead organizational change in a dynamic, fast-paced environment, ensuring seamless transitions, transparency, and business continuity. At IC4, you&#39;re driving change—not just managing through it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Drive workforce planning, talent calibration, and performance management activities across P&amp;amp;E, enabling consistent and defensible people decisions. Apply deep expertise to hold the bar on job architecture and leveling in a function where those lines can blur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Risk &amp;amp; Workplace Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;: Independently manage complex people matters, balancing risk, speed, and business practicality with sound judgment. Own the resolution, not just the escalation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead effective collaboration with People Team COEs and other stakeholders to deliver scalable, business-aligned people solutions. Share insights and practices that raise the quality of work across the broader PBP team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
