&lt;p&gt;CoreWeave is seeking a Senior Productivity Platforms Developer to own, administer, and scale our collaboration and work management platforms, including Atlassian (Jira, Confluence), Asana, and other enterprise productivity tools. The ideal candidate has extensive experience configuring, integrating, and maintaining modern productivity platforms to support agile development and cross-functional collaboration at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
