&lt;li&gt;Administer and configure Jira Cloud, Confluence Cloud, Asana, and other productivity tools to support agile workflows, project tracking, and knowledge management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering, product, and business stakeholders to design workflows, permissions, and governance models tailored to each team’s needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain custom integrations between Jira, Asana, and other tools in our development and business stack (e.g., GitHub, GitLab, Kubernetes, Slack).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use REST APIs and backend programming (Python and/or Go) to automate workflows and improve how systems work together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and optimize platform performance and scalability. Collaborate with infrastructure teams on uptime, backups, upgrades, and efficient operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee user provisioning, permissions, and security audits across platforms to maintain compliance and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish standards, guardrails, and best practices across productivity platforms while enabling self-service for teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain dashboards and reports across Jira, Asana, and Confluence that give leadership and teams visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document workflows, configurations, and policies in Confluence to support knowledge sharing and consistent adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in an on-call rotation as an escalation point of contact for the IT Support &amp;amp; Operations team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train teams across the organization on best practices and effective use of productivity platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience administering Jira Cloud and Confluence Cloud, including advanced configuration, permissions, automation, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience administering and configuring Asana (projects, portfolios, reporting, governance).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of agile methodologies (Scrum, Kanban, etc.) and how to support them in work management tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience developing custom integrations and automations using REST APIs and backend programming (Python and/or Go).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD and DevOps toolchains (GitHub, GitLab, Kubernetes, Slack).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong skills in security hardening, compliance, and governance across multiple SaaS platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal, communication, and stakeholder management skills, with experience supporting both technical and non-technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
