&lt;li&gt;Experience securing cloud infrastructure or large-scale production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Python or another scripting language to automate security workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with incident response in Kubernetes-based infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with detection engineering, threat intelligence, or software engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
