&lt;li&gt;You enjoy building backend APIs and distributed services that automate real-world infrastructure operations at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are curious about how large fleets of bare metal servers are provisioned, updated, and repaired across many data centers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are excited to collaborate with hardware, data center, and platform engineers to turn complex procedures into reliable automation.&lt;/li&gt;
