&lt;li&gt;You love to grow and push the boundaries of your expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re curious about distributed storage and the demands AI/ML workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re an expert in data persistence on physical media, high performance data transfer using RDMA, or resilient distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
