&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_1770241969069985273m_-2746164444908759431gmail-docs-internal-guid-131e4fb0-7fff-b4e9-ff50-e8cf32449b1b&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is The Essential Cloud for AI™. Built for pioneers by pioneers, CoreWeave delivers a platform of technology, tools, and teams that enables innovators to build and scale AI with confidence. Trusted by leading AI labs, startups, and global enterprises, CoreWeave combines superior infrastructure performance with deep technical expertise to accelerate breakthroughs and turn compute into capability. Founded in 2017, CoreWeave became a publicly traded company (Nasdaq: CRWV) in March 2025. Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.coreweave.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.coreweave.com&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1762613132717000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3D-UOhNaqEvF5BEWxjYyAU&quot;&gt;www.coreweave.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdntn wnfdntm _1ibi0s35e _1ibi0s36a&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is building the infrastructure that powers the next era of AI, at a pace and scale that demands operational excellence across every function. We’re looking for a Technical Program Manager to join the CIO organization and drive programs that connect Data Center Operations, Supply Chain, Finance, and IT. You’ll deliver the systems, integrations, and workflows that support predictable site expansion, trusted operational data, and reliable execution across CoreWeave.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdntn wnfdntm _1ibi0s35e _1ibi0s36a&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You will lead technical programs within Data Center Operations and across the functions that support the data center lifecycle. Your scope will span data center infrastructure management (DCIM), telemetry, asset management, lifecycle platforms, and their dependencies on procurement, inventory, financial systems, and IT.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You will connect workstreams into integrated plans, resolve cross-functional dependencies, and drive accountability from discovery through rollout and stabilization. The Technical Program Manager owns the integrated execution plan, delivery cadence, dependency and risk management, and readiness coordination. Business owners and the DC PMO own business requirements, approvals, and change management; Product Management owns product scope and acceptance criteria; Engineering owns technical design, implementation, testing, and technical support. You will bring these owners together to deliver agreed outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You will lead programs across multiple teams and functions, including interconnected initiatives across sites. You will resolve competing priorities with senior stakeholders, manage critical paths across programs, and establish delivery mechanisms adopted by multiple teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Own integrated delivery plans for programs spanning Data Center Operations, Supply Chain, Finance, and IT, with clear scope, milestones, owners, dependencies, risks, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Connect site expansion and operational technology initiatives with procurement, equipment availability, inventory and asset records, financial processes, and IT readiness. Identify gaps between functional plans and drive decisions before they affect delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Drive DCIM deployment and site onboarding programs, coordinating asset data readiness, integrations, vendor commitments, testing, and operational handoffs to improve onboarding predictability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Partner with Facilities, Engineering, Data teams, and suppliers to improve telemetry coverage and data quality. Track monitoring gaps, alerting issues, and remediation through closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Lead asset-system migrations and legacy-tool retirement, coordinating data reconciliation, downstream dependencies, cutover and rollback plans, and clear exit criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Coordinate delivery across lifecycle platforms, construction milestone integrations, enterprise systems, and operational dashboards, ensuring workflow and data changes remain consistent across functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Maintain a unified view of program commitments, critical paths, risks, and decisions. Run effective planning and execution cadences, keep owners accountable, and escalate conflicts with clear options and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Maintain traceability from approved business requirements and product acceptance criteria through implementation, testing, and launch readiness. Ensure decisions and sign-offs come from the accountable owners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Orchestrate business UAT, go-live readiness, and operational handoffs. Coordinate with the DC PMO on training and communications and with Engineering on hypercare and support readiness, accounting for live-site constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Track outcomes such as predictable site onboarding, trusted asset and telemetry data, reliable integrations, adoption, and issue resolution. Build reusable plans, dashboards, and playbooks that improve execution across CoreWeave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdntn wnfdntm _1ibi0s35e _1ibi0s36a&quot;&gt;Who You Are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You have demonstrated delivery experience with a complex systems implementation or migration involving integrations, data readiness, testing, and operational handoff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You have experience leading technical programs across multiple business functions and can connect operational needs, enterprise systems, and technical delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You have strong fundamentals in integrated planning, critical-path analysis, dependency management, risk tracking, resource coordination, and driving decisions to closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You can interpret system diagrams, APIs, integrations, data flows, migration approaches, and testing dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You are familiar with data center operations and their connections to procurement, inventory, asset lifecycle, financial processes, and IT systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You have practical experience using Agile, Scrum, or Kanban to manage delivery, with tools such as Jira and Asana.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You have proven stakeholder-management experience across operational leaders, technical teams, business system owners, and external vendors, including resolving conflicting commitments and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You communicate clearly in writing and verbally, including concise executive updates that connect progress, risks, and decisions to business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You have demonstrated experience resolving priorities across senior stakeholders, managing dependencies across multiple programs, and establishing operating mechanisms used beyond your immediate team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdntn wnfdntm _1ibi0s35e _1ibi0s36a&quot;&gt;Preferred&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Experience with Sunbird or other DCIM platforms, CMMS/EAM systems, BMS/EPMS or telemetry platforms, and asset-management tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Experience with Supply Chain or Finance systems supporting procurement, inventory, logistics, ERP, or fixed-asset processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Experience with Asana portfolios, SiteTracker, integration platforms, and operational reporting or dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Experience delivering multi-site rollouts, legacy-system retirement, data migrations, or vendor transitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Familiarity with live-site change controls, maintenance windows, operational support models, and audit readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Experience coordinating automation, first-party applications, or AI-enabled workflows across business functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wondering if you’re a good fit? We believe in investing in our people and value candidates who bring unique backgrounds—even if you don’t check every box. Here are a few qualities we’ve found make someone successful on our team. If some of this describes you, we’d love to talk.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You enjoy connecting operational needs, enterprise systems, and technical delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You’re comfortable coordinating across teams and vendors and bringing risks, dependencies, and decisions into focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You like building reusable plans and operating mechanisms that help teams execute consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdntn wnfdntm _1ibi0s35e _1ibi0s36a&quot;&gt;Why CoreWeave?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;At CoreWeave, we work hard, have fun, and move fast! We’re in an exciting stage of hyper-growth that you will not want to miss out on. We’re not afraid of a little chaos, and we’re constantly learning. Our team cares deeply about how we build our product and how we work together, which is represented through our core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Be Curious at Your Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Act Like an Owner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Empower Employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Deliver Best-in-Class Client Experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Achieve More Together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;We support and encourage an entrepreneurial outlook and independent thinking. We foster an environment that encourages collaboration and enables the development of innovative solutions to complex problems. As we get set for takeoff, the organization&#39;s growth opportunities are constantly expanding. You will be surrounded by some of the best talent in the industry, who will want to learn from you, too. Come join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;The base salary range for this role is $157,000 to $210,000. The starting salary will be determined by job-related knowledge, skills, experience, and the market location. We strive for both market alignment and internal equity when determining compensation. In addition to base salary, our total rewards package includes a discretionary bonus, equity awards, and a comprehensive benefits program (all based on eligibility).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The range we’ve posted represents the typical compensation range for this role. To determine actual compensation, we review the market rate for each candidate which can include a variety of factors. These include qualifications, experience, interview performance, and location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, we offer a variety of benefits to support your needs. The benefits below reflect our US-based offerings for full-time employees; for roles in other locations, benefits vary and are shared during the hiring process. These include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, dental, and vision insurance - 100% paid for by CoreWeave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid Life Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Voluntary supplemental life insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short and long-term disability insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Spending Account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Savings Account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to Participate in Employee Stock Purchase Program (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Wellness Benefits through Spring Health&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-Forming support provided by Carrot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Parental Leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, full-service childcare support with Kinside&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with a generous employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Catered lunch each day in our office and data center locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A casual work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work culture focused on innovative disruption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;California Applicants&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gPBRBhUNAMBmj7Yn4_M-hCugm7ZJD4hr/view?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Consumer Privacy Act&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity &amp;amp; Accommodations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CoreWeave is an equal opportunity employer, committed to fostering an inclusive and supportive workplace. All qualified applicants and candidates will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, disability, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran status, or genetic information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of this commitment and consistent with the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/laws/guidance/fact-sheet-disability-discrimination&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, CoreWeave will ensure that qualified applicants and candidates with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations for the hiring process, unless such accommodation would cause an undue hardship. If reasonable accommodation is needed, please contact: &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:careers@coreweave.com&quot;&gt;careers@coreweave.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
