&lt;p&gt;The Strategy and Transformation team builds intelligent internal systems that improve how CoreWeave operates. The team partners with groups including Finance, Supply Chain, HR, and core business operations to develop AI-powered workflows and first-party applications that connect enterprise platforms such as ERP, HRIS, MRP, PDM, and DCIM.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a curious, energetic, and innovative &lt;strong&gt;Software and AI Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Strategy and Transformation team. You’ll help build intelligent AI agents and full-stack applications supporting Finance, Supply Chain, HR, Legal and Data center operations, integrating with systems such as ERP, HRIS, MRP, PDM, and DCIM.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for an early-career engineer with solid programming fundamentals who wants to grow at the intersection of software engineering, product development, and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;5:1-5:20;619-638&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Software and AI Engineer, IT Systems, you’ll develop well-defined features, application components, and AI workflows with guidance from experienced engineers. You’ll contribute across the development lifecycle, including implementation, testing, deployment, documentation, and production support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll gain hands-on experience with AI frameworks and APIs such as LangChain, LangGraph, OpenAI, Gemini, and Glean; integration platforms such as Workato or Boomi; React-based interfaces; and backend services written in Node.js, Go, or Python.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-9:17;1156-1172&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain scoped features for internal AI agents, copilots, and first-party applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build user interfaces using React, TypeScript, and modern frontend frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement backend services and automation scripts for data processing and workflow orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate LLM APIs and AI capabilities into applications using established designs and engineering patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain APIs and enterprise integrations under the guidance of experienced engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write tests, troubleshoot defects, and participate in code reviews to improve application quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add logging, monitoring, and error handling to support reliable application operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow established security, access control, deployment, and documentation practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI development tools such as Cursor, Claude, GitHub Copilot, and Codex, reviewing and validating generated code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineers and business stakeholders to understand requirements and incorporate feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of assigned work, communicate progress, and raise blockers promptly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ year of hands-on software development experience, including relevant internships, co-op assignments, or substantial project work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency in one or more programming languages such as TypeScript, Python, Go, Java, C#, or C++.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of programming fundamentals, data structures, debugging, and software testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of system design concepts and the ability to evaluate tradeoffs across performance, reliability, cost, and maintainability, with guidance from experienced engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building web applications or backend services using frameworks such as React, Next.js, Node.js, or FastAPI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with RESTful APIs, databases, and basic application integration concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Git, collaborative development, and CI/CD concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of cloud platforms such as AWS, Azure, or GCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to LLM APIs, AI frameworks, or AI-powered application development through professional, academic, or personal projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to learn new technologies, incorporate feedback, and complete well-defined tasks with guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication skills and an interest in building tools that improve business productivity and employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;23:1-23:15;3203-3217&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building an AI-powered application, chatbot, or automation workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to LangChain, LangGraph, OpenAI, Gemini, Glean, or similar frameworks and APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Workato, Boomi, or other integration and automation platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scripting in Python or Bash.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to containers, application monitoring, or cloud deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in Finance, Supply Chain, HR, or other enterprise business workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to user experience, code quality, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdntn wnfdntm _1ibi0s35e _1ibi0s36a&quot;&gt;Why CoreWeave?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;At CoreWeave, we work hard, have fun, and move fast! We’re in an exciting stage of hyper-growth that you will not want to miss out on. We’re not afraid of a little chaos, and we’re constantly learning. Our team cares deeply about how we build our product and how we work together, which is represented through our core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Be Curious at Your Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Act Like an Owner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Empower Employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Deliver Best-in-Class Client Experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Achieve More Together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;We support and encourage an entrepreneurial outlook and independent thinking. We foster an environment that encourages collaboration and enables the development of innovative solutions to complex problems. As we get set for takeoff, the organization’s growth opportunities are constantly expanding. You will be surrounded by some of the best talent in the industry, who will want to learn from you, too. Come join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnt10 _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;The base salary range for this role is $120,000 to $160,000. The starting salary will be determined by job-related knowledge, skills, experience, and the market location. We strive for both market alignment and internal equity when determining compensation. In addition to base salary, our total rewards package includes a discretionary bonus, equity awards, and a comprehensive benefits program (all based on eligibility).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The range we’ve posted represents the typical compensation range for this role. To determine actual compensation, we review the market rate for each candidate which can include a variety of factors. These include qualifications, experience, interview performance, and location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, we offer a variety of benefits to support your needs. The benefits below reflect our US-based offerings for full-time employees; for roles in other locations, benefits vary and are shared during the hiring process. These include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, dental, and vision insurance - 100% paid for by CoreWeave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid Life Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Voluntary supplemental life insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short and long-term disability insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Spending Account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Savings Account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to Participate in Employee Stock Purchase Program (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Wellness Benefits through Spring Health&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-Forming support provided by Carrot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Parental Leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, full-service childcare support with Kinside&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with a generous employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Catered lunch each day in our office and data center locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A casual work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work culture focused on innovative disruption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
