&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;The Strategy and Transformation team builds intelligent systems and first-party applications that improve how CoreWeave’s internal teams work. The team partners with Finance, Supply Chain, HR, and core business operations to connect workflows across enterprise platforms, including ERP, HRIS, MRP, PDM, and DCIM.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdntj wnfdnti _1ibi0s35e _1ibi0s36a&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;As a Software and AI Engineer, IT Systems, you’ll design and build AI agents, copilots, and first-party applications that make CoreWeave’s internal workflows more intelligent, automated, and intuitive. You’ll work across applied AI, product design, and full-stack engineering—from agentic workflows built with integration platforms and AI frameworks to React interfaces and backend services in Node.js and Go.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Develop AI agents and copilots for Finance, Billing, Supply Chain, and other internal teams, using frameworks and APIs such as LangChain, LangGraph, Cohere, OpenAI, Gemini, and Glean.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Design and build first-party web and mobile applications using React, TypeScript, and modern front-end frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Develop scalable backend services in Node.js and Go for data processing, orchestration, and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Integrate enterprise systems—including ERP, HRIS, MRP, PDM, DCIM, and data warehouses—through native integrations or iPaaS platforms such as Workato or Boomi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Build APIs and microservices that support modular, event-driven application architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Use GenAI development tools such as Cursor, Claude, Copilot, and ChatGPT Codex to accelerate implementation, testing, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Build observability, maintainability, and security into applications across the stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Partner with stakeholders in Finance, Accounting, Security, Engineering, and other business teams to design useful, user-centered workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdntj wnfdnti _1ibi0s35e _1ibi0s36a&quot;&gt;Who You Are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You have 3+ years of programming experience in C++, Go, C#, Java, TypeScript, or Python, building production-grade cloud services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You have 3+ years of scripting experience in Python or Bash for automation and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You have solid experience designing RESTful APIs and event-driven integration architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You have experience building and deploying production-grade applications and microservices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You have experience with cloud environments (AWS, Azure, or GCP), container orchestration, and DevOps and CI/CD practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You have experience with modern backend and frontend technologies; familiarity with React, TypeScript, Node.js, Go, FastAPI, Next.js, Kestrel, or gRPC is relevant to this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You’re familiar with generative AI frameworks and APIs, such as LangChain, LangGraph, OpenAI, or Glean, and how they can be applied in products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You’re motivated by building user-facing tools that improve business productivity and employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdntj wnfdnti _1ibi0s35e _1ibi0s36a&quot;&gt;Preferred Skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Experience shipping production-grade AI, ML, or LLM-based applications at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Experience developing AI-powered or agentic applications integrated with enterprise data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Familiarity with machine learning and data engineering platforms such as Ray, Kafka, or Spark.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Experience with iPaaS platforms such as Workato or Boomi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Exposure to Finance, Supply Chain, or other operational domains where intelligent automation can drive efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Experience with AI-assisted development tools such as Cursor, Claude, or ChatGPT Codex.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;A collaborative approach and an eye for user experience and long-term system maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntj wnfdnti _1ibi0s35e _1ibi0s36a&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wondering if you’re a good fit?&amp;nbsp;We believe in investing in our people and value candidates who bring unique backgrounds—even if you don’t check every box. Here are a few qualities we’ve found make someone successful on our team. If some of this describes you, we’d love to talk.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You’re curious about how AI and software can make everyday work simpler and more effective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You enjoy turning complex business needs into clear, approachable experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You communicate well with both technical and non-technical partners and like building solutions together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You balance moving quickly with building systems that are secure, maintainable, and dependable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdntj wnfdnti _1ibi0s35e _1ibi0s36a&quot;&gt;Why CoreWeave?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;At CoreWeave, we work hard, have fun, and move fast! We’re in an exciting stage of hyper-growth that you will not want to miss out on. We’re not afraid of a little chaos, and we’re constantly learning. Our team cares deeply about how we build our product and how we work together, which is represented through our core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Be Curious at Your Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Act Like an Owner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntw _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Empower Employees&lt;/li&gt;
