&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About CoreWeave&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CoreWeave is an AI cloud built for high-performance GPU workloads across AI/ML, VFX, rendering, and real-time inference. Our stack is engineered for speed, scale, and cost efficiency—providing a powerful alternative to traditional hyperscalers. Infrastructure is our product, and we operate it at a massive scale to power the most demanding workloads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Junior Software Engineer (IC1/IC2) on the Inference team, you’ll own a single production service end-to-end shipping features, maintaining dashboards/alarms, and improving operational excellence. You’ll collaborate with peers across runtime, scheduling, and networking to move key SLIs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own one model-serving service end-to-end: design, implementation, tests, deployment, and ops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add and tune observability (dashboards, alerts, traces); automate runbook steps to reduce toil.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve latency/throughput via micro-batching, concurrency tuning, and caching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in on-call; lead post-incident action items for your service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review peers’ PRs and contribute design feedback in team reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;0–3 years of software engineering experience (or equivalent) building cloud/distributed services in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python or Go; familiarity with gRPC/HTTP APIs and containerized deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Kubernetes (or Slurm/Ray) and CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with metrics/alerting (Prometheus/Grafana/OpenTelemetry) and structured logging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of GPU inference concepts (KV caching, mixed precision, streaming tokens).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with inference frameworks (Triton, vLLM, TensorRT-LLM, Ray Serve, TorchServe).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on performance profiling/benchmarking (e.g., wrk, vegeta, perf, Nsight).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions to reliability practices: SLI/SLOs or postmortem improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why CoreWeave&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help shape an industry-defining inference platform that enables teams to deploy generative AI and real-time applications at scale. If optimizing tail latency and delivering reliable model serving excites you, this is the place to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits (highlights)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
