&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Vision and Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Help refine the product strategy for AI application cloud services aimed at foundational model Inference, along with focus on optimization across the entire CoreWeave product portfolio for AI workloads. Solve novel problems related to scaling AI model inference on specialized hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roadmap Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the product roadmap for AI inference services, balancing near-term customer needs with long-term vision, to deliver differentiated and scalable AI cloud services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI and Cloud Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay current on advancements in AI/ML technologies including inference engines, model serving architectures, cloud infrastructures, and software development methodologies to inform product decisions and foster innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define product portfolio:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage ambiguity and complexity of a fast evolving AI landscape to define new product investments and develop a portfolio of inference capabilities that deliver long-term differentiation and customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with key customers to understand their AI workloads, pain points, and future requirements to continuously improve our service offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with engineering, sales, marketing, and customer success teams to ensure seamless product development and deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze market trends, customer feedback, and the competitive landscape to identify growth opportunities and ensure CoreWeave stays ahead of industry trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-Market Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with industry partners, marketing, and sales teams to develop and execute effective go-to-market strategies for AI cloud services, including pricing strategies, positioning, messaging, and competitive differentiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 8+ years of experience in product management, with at least 5 years in the cloud services or AI/ML market segment.&lt;/li&gt;
