&lt;li&gt;You love to build businesses as much as build products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re curious about where the next product opportunity is, and where the AI market is going&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re an expert in the fundamentals of how computers work at scale, and the implications of distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
