&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;34:1-34:72;2861-2932&quot;&gt;Experience with SOX, data privacy, and information security controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;35:1-35:60;2933-2992&quot;&gt;Experience with automation tools or process optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
