&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdnti _1ibi0s35e _1ibi0s36a&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;The Treasury Accounting team is responsible for the accurate accounting, reporting, and control environment for CoreWeave’s treasury-related activities, including debt, OEM and vendor financing arrangements, derivative instruments, and hedging programs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;As the Treasury Accounting Manager, you will operationalize the accounting for CoreWeave’s growing derivatives and hedging portfolio, including interest rate swaps, foreign exchange hedges, cross-currency swaps, and power hedges. Reporting to the Director of Treasury Accounting, with a dotted-line reporting relationship to the Senior Manager, Treasury Accounting, you will own the day-to-day accounting and operational execution of derivative and hedging activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;You will partner closely with Treasury, Energy Management, and other cross-functional teams to ensure new transactions are incorporated into accounting and close processes timely and accurately. You will maintain appropriate documentation and supporting information, complete ongoing hedge accounting requirements, and help coordinate recurring activities across Treasury and Treasury Accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Beyond derivatives, you will help drive the broader operating rhythm of the Treasury Accounting team. This includes coordinating monthly and quarterly deliverables, preparing flux analyses and financial close materials, supporting financial instrument disclosures, and helping build scalable processes as CoreWeave continues to grow. This role requires a strong sense of ownership, sound judgment, attention to detail, and a proactive approach to obtaining information and driving deliverables to completion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdnti _1ibi0s35e _1ibi0s36a&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;wnfdntf&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s35c&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Manage the day-to-day accounting and operational execution for derivative and hedging transactions, including interest rate swaps, FX forwards and other foreign currency hedges, cross-currency swaps, and power hedges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s35c&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Coordinate with Treasury to understand newly executed derivative transactions and ensure they are incorporated into accounting, reporting, and control processes timely and accurately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s35c&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Prepare and review monthly and quarterly journal entries, account reconciliations, rollforwards, and other supporting schedules related to derivative and hedging activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s35c&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Obtain, organize, and maintain trade confirmations, valuation reports, settlement information, counterparty statements, and other supporting documentation for derivative transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s35c&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Prepare and maintain hedge designation documentation and other contemporaneous hedge accounting documentation in accordance with ASC 815.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s35c&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Perform and document ongoing quantitative and qualitative hedge effectiveness assessments, partnering with Treasury and other stakeholders as needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s35c&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Reconcile derivative valuations, settlements, cash activity, and related balance sheet and income statement accounts to third-party and Treasury records.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s35c&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Research accounting matters related to derivatives and hedging and prepare supporting documentation for review by the Senior Manager and Director of Treasury Accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s35c&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Prepare supporting schedules and disclosures related to derivatives, hedging activities, and other financial instruments for the company’s 10-Q and 10-K filings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s35c&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Maintain and support SOX controls over derivatives and hedge accounting processes, including control documentation and audit support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s35c&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Coordinate monthly meetings between Treasury Accounting and Treasury, including scheduling meetings, developing agendas, tracking open items, and following up on action items.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s35c&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Create and maintain quarterly deliverable packages with Treasury to ensure information required for close, financial reporting, controls, and audit support is received timely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s35c&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Prepare monthly and quarterly Treasury Accounting flux analyses and coordinate with team members and stakeholders to understand and document significant period-over-period movements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s35c&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Collaborate with the broader Treasury Accounting team on materials for monthly and quarterly financial close decks and other management reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s35c&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Champion AI initiatives for the Treasury Accounting team by identifying practical opportunities to improve the efficiency and quality of accounting, reporting, documentation, and recurring processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s35c&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Support the Treasury Accounting team’s ERP transition, including process design, data validation, testing, implementation activities, and development of scalable post-implementation workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
